### 3. Implementation Details

The Analytics component is correctly placed according to official Vercel documentation:

```typescript
import { Analytics } from '@vercel/analytics/react';

export default function App() {
  return (
    <HelmetProvider>
      <CartProvider>
        <BrowserRouter>
          {/* App content */}
          <Analytics />
        </BrowserRouter>
      </CartProvider>
    </HelmetProvider>
  );
}
```

This follows the recommended pattern for React/Vite applications as documented at:
https://vercel.com/docs/analytics/quickstart

